\f2 This file was used for SPL, Chirp rate, and movement analysis to determine whether SPL and Chirp rate change post-exposure and/or with treatment type. The movement data was used to compare the movement between the two experiments (No Playback at Start or Playback at Start).\'a0 The relevant analysis and figures can be found in the results section with the subheading \'93Change In Call characteristics\'94 and \'93Locomotory Response\'94. The relevant figures are in the main manuscript as Figure 5a,\'a0 Figure 5b,\'a0 Figure 7a and Figure 7b.
